  "instance_name": "white_settler",
  "label": "White settler",
  "description": "A term used in historical and political discourse to refer to European colonizers who settled in territories outside their home continent, often displacing or subjugating indigenous populations. In contemporary usage, especially in decolonial and anti-racist discourse, it is often used to critique the cultural appropriation and historical injustices committed by white settlers in colonized lands. The meme targets this group by implying their cultural engagement is morally bankrupt.",
